  "description": "Repairs r-dao-1-err-1/err-base-scope: the 'independent DBEngine' was a second CoCreate in the same process and returned the same object (u1), so it was not independent. Two worker processes: A opens the fixture read-only, reads DBEngine.Errors, runs OpenRecordset('NoSuchTable') (snapshot), reads Errors, signals, and waits for B; B waits for A's signal, creates its own DAO.DBEngine.120, reads its Errors (before any failure of its own), runs OpenDatabase of a file that does not exist (read-only), reads its Errors, and signals; A then reads its Errors again and runs a snapshot OpenRecordset of T. Asks whether a failure in one DBEngine appears in the Errors of a truly independent engine, and the converse.",
